# Sample requests. Open in VS Code (REST Client extension) or Rider and click "Send Request".
# Start the API first: dotnet run --project src/ImpiantiTracker.Api

@api = http://localhost:5080

### Maintenance plan: overdue + due in the next 30 days
GET {{api}}/api/maintenance

### Everything, with a 60-day window
GET {{api}}/api/maintenance?days=60&all=true

### Installations in one city
GET {{api}}/api/installations?city=Catanzaro

### One installation with its history
GET {{api}}/api/installations/1

### Record a maintenance visit
POST {{api}}/api/installations/1/visits
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "kind": "Maintenance",
  "technician": "K. Kier",
  "cost": 140.50,
  "notes": "Annual service, filters replaced"
}

### A visit that fails validation (future date, negative cost)
POST {{api}}/api/installations/1/visits
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2030-01-01",
  "kind": "Repair",
  "technician": "K. Kier",
  "cost": -5
}

### Yearly report
GET {{api}}/api/reports/2026

### CSV for Excel
GET {{api}}/api/maintenance/export?all=true

### Health
GET {{api}}/health

### OpenAPI description
GET {{api}}/openapi/v1.json
